            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/2a59ca4089ead451ac3504f7df64a0b5.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend of Monsters is a fast, brutal top-down arena shooter built for players who love a real challenge. Armed with a growing arsenal of weapons and facing waves of clever, relentless enemies, every run tests your reflexes and your nerve — perfect for quick, high-intensity sessions that never feel repetitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Alex, on a desperate mission to rescue his sister Ana from the clutches of Dark Bit deep within the underworld of a video game. Monsters, traps, dangerous caves, haunted forests, castles, and dungeons stand in the way. Alex's only ally is a mysterious gun smuggler — a veteran of other zombie survival games — who arms him with a shotgun and opens up a shop full of gear to prepare for the fight ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/e51fe7545588bf1c433af550c796ce71.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clear every monster from an area to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Procedurally generated levels mean no two runs ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chase a high score in the dedicated Arcade Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Kill monsters and smash objects to earn coins for new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose from 11 distinct weapons, each with its own strengths and trade-offs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, casual sessions perfect for quick play or long survival runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/7f94bb6d9c366faf7a3500678d020a04.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span><strong>Beautiful and Brutal:</strong> Retro pixel art collides with a frantic, high-stakes battlefield full of chaotic fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon and Enemy Variety:</strong> Multiple weapon types, each suited to different situations, versus a smart, prepared enemy army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never the Same Twice:</strong> Every level is randomly generated, so each playthrough is a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Test your skills across endless randomized stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs on Anything:</strong> Lightweight enough to play on almost any PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Unlock a full set of achievements as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the ranks and outscore other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Compatible with Xbox, PlayStation, and generic controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your shotgun, gear up at the smuggler's shop, and dive into the underworld — wishlist Legend of Monsters now and get ready for the fight of your life!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/2a59ca4089ead451ac3504f7df64a0b5.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend of Monsters is a fast, brutal top-down arena shooter built for players who love a real challenge. Armed with a growing arsenal of weapons and facing waves of clever, relentless enemies, every run tests your reflexes and your nerve — perfect for quick, high-intensity sessions that never feel repetitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Alex, on a desperate mission to rescue his sister Ana from the clutches of Dark Bit deep within the underworld of a video game. Monsters, traps, dangerous caves, haunted forests, castles, and dungeons stand in the way. Alex's only ally is a mysterious gun smuggler — a veteran of other zombie survival games — who arms him with a shotgun and opens up a shop full of gear to prepare for the fight ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/e51fe7545588bf1c433af550c796ce71.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clear every monster from an area to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Procedurally generated levels mean no two runs ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chase a high score in the dedicated Arcade Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Kill monsters and smash objects to earn coins for new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose from 11 distinct weapons, each with its own strengths and trade-offs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, casual sessions perfect for quick play or long survival runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/640970/extras/7f94bb6d9c366faf7a3500678d020a04.avif?t=1793545118\" width=616 height=125 /></span><strong>Beautiful and Brutal:</strong> Retro pixel art collides with a frantic, high-stakes battlefield full of chaotic fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon and Enemy Variety:</strong> Multiple weapon types, each suited to different situations, versus a smart, prepared enemy army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never the Same Twice:</strong> Every level is randomly generated, so each playthrough is a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Test your skills across endless randomized stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs on Anything:</strong> Lightweight enough to play on almost any PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Unlock a full set of achievements as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the ranks and outscore other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Compatible with Xbox, PlayStation, and generic controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your shotgun, gear up at the smuggler's shop, and dive into the underworld — wishlist Legend of Monsters now and get ready for the fight of your life!</p>",
